This image redistributes the Kangaroo MuJoCo models (MJCF + meshes) from PAL Robotics'
`kangaroo_mujoco` ROS 2 package (ros-humble-kangaroo-mujoco), licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. Its package.xml is kept at /opt/kangaroo/package.xml in the image.

LIBERO (hf-libero), robosuite and MuJoCo are installed from PyPI under their own licenses.
